We&#39;re using UseMod&#39;s sub-pages feature to name the pages for the individual hosts. A sub-page is denoted by the parent page name, a slash (&quot;/&quot;), and the sub-page name. The nice thing about the sub-page feature is that each sub-page has in its header and footer a link to the parent.

So the sub-pages for the hosting services included to date are:
* [[Cheap Hosting/Powerhoster]]
* [[Cheap Hosting/Catalog]]
* [[Cheap Hosting/T-Online]]

